title: "Plant Intelligence Lab: Genomic Prediction, Phenotype Forecasting & AI-Assisted Biological Decision Systems"
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
  - family-names: "Pereira"
    given-names: "Rodolfo"
repository-code: "https://github.com/rolffcoelho-bravo/plant-intelligence-lab"
abstract: "Python research software for computational plant biotechnology, combining genomic prediction, high-dimensional machine learning, early phenotype forecasting, conformal uncertainty quantification, selective prediction, retrospective experiment prioritization, and evidence-grounded scientific interaction using public plant data."
keywords:
  - genomic prediction
  - quantitative genetics
  - plant biotechnology
  - machine learning
  - phenotype forecasting
  - uncertainty quantification
  - conformal prediction
  - selective prediction
  - experiment prioritization
  - biological decision support
  - grounded scientific AI
